 "$comment": "Electricity tier power grid (ADR-590). Pieces by key: role source|battery|consumer|pylon. Watts are steady draw/output; store = battery capacity in Wh of sim time (UI shows %), rate = max charge/discharge W. reach (tiles) = how far this node links to others: two nodes of the same tribe link when their distance <= max(reachA, reachB) (consumers reach 0, so they must sit inside a source / battery / pylon reach). use: when a consumer is 'in use' (draws full watts and plays its active animation): switch = player toggle (default on), craft = someone crafting at it, food = container holds items, grow = a crop is growing on it, always = whenever powered. Not in use = standbyFraction of watts. Grid solve every everyTicks; topology rebuilt only when the node set changes (or topologyEveryTicks as a safety net). coldC (fridge / freezer): while powered the container's food sits at this temperature (a freezer at or below 0 C holds food age still, like frozen ground storage); unpowered it is ordinary storage.",
